<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tribune Co cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tribune Co cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns has cut its rating for Tribune Co to attractive from buy, a source at the brokerage said Monday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the media company opened Monday off 3/8 to 52-5/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
